"overload_flow_q4\", \"ratio_q3_q1\"], column_units: [null, null, \"mm\", \"m³/h\", \"m³/h\", \"m³/h\", \"m³/h\", null].\n\nFootnotes array entry marker \"*\".\n\nEverything set. Write final JSON. Ensure valid JSON: no trailing commas, proper quoting (escape inner quotes in footnote text: \\\"DNxxx RB\\\").\n\nOne more check: \"Number R49/2013-A-NL1-21.03 revision 7\" — number includes revision suffix; I separate. Good.\n\nAlso scheme: \"This OIML Certificate is issued under scheme A.\" → \"A\".\n\nIssuer ID: \"NL1\" from \"OIML Issuing Authority NL1\" and cert number \"A-NL1-21.03\". Good.\n\nLet me now write the whole thing.",
